  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the agricultural research and rural extension service of Equatorial Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed to strengthening the agricultural extension service since it needs updated trainings for new extension techniques, including participatory and inter-sectoral learning and decision-making approaches, which cover crop management needs, as well as family economy with emphasis on the priorities and needs of actors in the rural sector. Based on the learning-in-action approach, this project aims to promote research and development of innovation and agricultural extension services in Equatorial Guinea for the benefit of small producers.</narrative>
  </description>
